      "num_turns": 20,
      "result": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener with MySQL-backed links and click counts, direct `/links` and `/r/{code}` routes, and an executable `start.sh` that runs migrations before serving on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README now explains how to start it.\n\nVerified migrations and exercised creation, duplicate-code handling, redirect status and `Location`, click tracking, listing, and invalid URL responses. The test server was stopped and its test link removed from the database.\n\nOne note: malformed JSON returns 422 with an `error` field, as required, though Laravel’s JSON parser treats the malformed body as empty input and the message may say the URL is required.",
